# 17. OFFLINE OPERATION

PRSL-AI is local-first rather than cloud-first.

When online:

Device
    ↓
iRiel Intelligence Server
    ↓
Temporal
    ↓
Durable Workflow


When offline:

Device
    ↓
Local Intelligence
    ↓
Local Context
    ↓
Local Task State
    ↓
Local Execution


When connectivity returns:

Local State
    +
Context Snapshot
    +
Pending Events
    ↓
iRiel Intelligence Server
    ↓
State Reconciliation
    ↓
Temporal


Offline operation therefore does not inherently represent loss of Personal Intelligence continuity.


