A new device does not automatically receive unrestricted access.

Canonical authorization flow:

Device
    ↓
Device Trust
    ↓
Identity Recognition
    ↓
Policy Evaluation
    ↓
Authorized Access


A revoked device may lose access without destroying the underlying Personal Intelligence Environment or workflow state.


